WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.569
Accessibility setup.

00:00:01.569 --> 00:00:05.412
Use device text-accessibility settings as needed.

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:12.707
In the app, set captions, audio level, increased contrast and reduced motion before starting.

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:18.669
Knowledge checks are untimed and can be reopened for review without penalty.
